{"id":"absolutamente","lemma":"absolutamente","pos":"adv","rank":901,"glosses":["absolutely; completely; entirely; totally; utterly; wholly (in absolute manner)","at all"],"ipa":"/absoˌlutaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-absolutamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"No encontré absolutamente nada.","en":"I didn't find a single thing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731921"},{"text":"No entiendo absolutamente nada.","en":"I'm not understanding anything.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735852"},{"text":"Mary se ve absolutamente imponente.","en":"Mary looks absolutely stunning.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803919"},{"text":"Tom no dijo absolutamente nada.","en":"Tom didn't say anything at all.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/801249"},{"text":"Tu conducta es absolutamente vergonzosa.","en":"Your conduct is absolutely shameful.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/734764"}]}